gdoc v2.10.0 is published and this is v2.9.0. `gdoc update` installs it.

gdoc v2.9.0

Usage: gdoc comments <url> [--since <cursor>] [--witness] [--wait <duration>]
  List the comment threads with their ranges, their replies and the next cursor.

  --since <cursor>   only what is newer than this cursor, which an earlier run printed
  --witness          export the document and say which threads the export still shows
  --wait <duration>  wait this long for something new before answering, written as 9m or 90s

  Example: gdoc comments https://docs.google.com/document/d/1AbC.../edit --since <cursor> --wait 9m
